# Allow-list: the image needs only the package, lockfiles and published audit outputs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!searchaudit/
!audits/*/results.json
!audits/*/report.pdf
!audits/*/prompts.json
# The SpaceX walkthrough (/r/spacex) also reads these at request time.
!audits/*/audit.yaml
!audits/*/cut-*.json
!audits/*/prompts.batch55.json
**/__pycache__
# The synthetic fixture is for local dev and tests only; keep it out of the public site.
audits/fixture
# Last match wins, so a secret cannot ride in on an allow rule above.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
